---
import ProjectPost from "../../../components/ProjectPost.astro";
import cover from "./20251101-1.png";

export const meta = {
    title: "halfsies: splitting bills with no backend",
    date: new Date(2025, 10, 1),
    description:
        "For those of us who don't want to give Splitwise our data or money",
    tech: ["react"],
    role: ["Engineering"],
    image: cover,
};
---

<ProjectPost meta={meta}>
    <p>
        For those of you who follow an honour system, and don't split bills
        between friends and colleagues at all, this might be a good time to turn
        back because I'll be talking about an expense splitting application.
    </p><p>
        In college, most people I knew used Splitwise to split expenses. This
        carried on to life after it. This was quite annoying to me because,
    </p><ol>
        <li>Not everyone is on Splitwise</li><li>
            Ads and feature-gating on the free version got too much after a
            point
        </li><li>
            I'm not exactly happily giving away data about how I spend my money
            to Splitwise
        </li>
    </ol><p>So here is what I want,</p><ol>
        <li>
            Something that everyone with a smartphone can use, without having to
            login, or create a new account
        </li><li>
            No ads, or feature-gating for something as simple as division
        </li><li>No data collection</li>
    </ol><p>
        I imagined this to be quite easy so I built it and called it <a
            href="https://halfsies.azan-n.com">halfsies</a
        >. It uses URL fragments for storing state which can be sent around
        using an encrypted messaging app like Signal and all this comes for
        &quot;free&quot;.
    </p>
</ProjectPost>
